      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>In each figure, two arrows are present inside of polygon and one arrow is present outside of polygon except for figure (d).</p>\n\n<p>In figure (d), all three arrows are present inside of the polygon.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/01/OIS14.PNG\" style=\"height: 80px; width: 78px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hence, figure (d) is odd one out.</p>\n",
