      "questionHtml": "<p>Choose the odd one out from among the given figures.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/10/F5_Hiteshri_28-10-2020_Swati_D4.png\" /></p>\n",
